  m_Name: TradeHoverPort
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: TradeHoverPort
  displayName: Hover Port
  description: 'A landing pad of glowing rings and a dome hangar. Runs hover freighters
    on 4 routes: they skim straight over land and water alike, and need no track.
    Build one in each of two towns (a town has housing or a town centre) and a trade
    route opens between them; caravans then go to and fro, and every trip brings
    coin and goods: more for long routes between big towns, and more on roads. Outposts
    the route passes produce more. Raiders attack caravans on the road.'
